      "grid_layout": {
        "layouts": [
          {
            "title": "SysId Instructions",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 18,
            "height": 6,
            "type": "Text Display",
            "properties": {
              "fontSize": 14
            },
            "topic": "",
            "default_value": "SYSTEM IDENTIFICATION (SysId)\n\n1. Switch Driver Station to TEST MODE\n2. Clear 15+ feet of space in front of robot\n3. Hold X button -> Drive motor characterization\n4. Hold Y button -> Angle motor characterization\n5. Tests generate .wpilog files on the RoboRIO\n6. Download logs and open in WPILib SysId tool\n7. Update kS, kV, kA, kP in swerve JSON configs\n\nWARNING: Robot will move during tests!\nKeep hands clear and have E-stop ready."
          },
